# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (`—`). Always use a plain hyphen (`-`) instead.

Applies to UI copy, translations, meta tags, README, comments, and any other text in the repo.

```text
❌ BAD: Trade, finance and logistics — in one conversation.
✅ GOOD: Trade, finance and logistics - in one conversation.
```

Before finishing an edit, search for `—` and replace any matches with `-`.
